      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MACBETH.\nThey have tied me to a stake. I cannot fly,\nBut, bear-like I must fight the course.—What’s he\nThat was not born of woman? Such a one\nAm I to fear, or none.",
